---
import Page from '../../layouts/Page.astro';
import { pages, serviceEntries } from '../../lib/registry';
const services = await serviceEntries();
---

<Page
  {...pages['/services/']}
  breadcrumbs={[
    { label: 'Start', href: '/' },
    { label: 'Services', href: '/services/' },
  ]}
>
  <header class="page-intro wrap">
    <p class="eyebrow">Practical AI · International remote consulting</p>
    <h1>A useful place to start.</h1>
    <p class="intro">
      Find a worthwhile opportunity, build one focused solution, or help your
      team put it to use. Choose the engagement that matches where you are now.
    </p>
  </header>
  <section class="wrap section" aria-label="Consulting engagements">
    <ol class="service-list">
      {services.map((service, i) => (
        <li>
          <span class="ordinal">0{i + 1}</span>
          <h2>
            <a href={`/services/${service.id}/`}>{service.data.shortTitle}</a>
          </h2>
          <p>{service.data.description}</p>
          <a
            class="arrow-link"
            href={`/services/${service.id}/`}
            aria-label={`Read ${service.data.shortTitle}`}
          >
            ↗
          </a>
        </li>
      ))}
    </ol>
  </section>
  <section class="reading">
    <h2>One workflow is a useful beginning.</h2>
    <p>
      We agree the problem, the boundary and what would count as a useful
      improvement before committing to a build. Ordinary automation, a clearer
      process or a decision to wait can be better than an agent.
    </p>
    <h2>Remote, with an accountable owner.</h2>
    <p>
      Engagements use working conversations, screen sharing, shared project
      records and documentation. We agree access, ownership, human review and
      handover responsibilities for the specific work.
    </p>
    <h2>Scope before price.</h2>
    <p>
      Workflow complexity, systems, data readiness, training and maintenance
      affect the proposal. After an initial conversation, we agree a written
      scope and proposal.{' '}
      <a href="/contact/">Tell me what you would like to improve.</a>
    </p>
    <p>
      <a href="/work/">Inspect public project evidence</a> or{' '}
      <a href="/experience/">explore my engineering experience</a>.
    </p>
  </section>
</Page>
